><secondary>Lojban</secondary></indexterm>  <indexterm type=3D"general-impo=
rted"><primary>Lojban alphabet</primary></indexterm>  <indexterm type=3D"ge=
neral-imported"><primary>Latin alphabet</primary></indexterm> Lojban uses a=
